flowchart TD
    P[Producer] -->|Send message| B[Broker queue]
    B -->|Deliver| C[Consumer in a consumer group]
    C --> R{Processing result}
    R -->|Success| A[ACK: offset committed and message removed]
    R -->|Failure| N{Retry budget left?}
    N -->|Yes| RQ[NACK: message requeued for redelivery]
    RQ --> B
    N -->|No, attempts exhausted| D[Move to the dead-letter queue for manual review]
